@startuml builder_pattern
title Builder Pattern — Car Listing Construction

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "patterns.builder" {
  class CarListingBuilder <<Builder>> {
    - _owner_id, _make, _model, _year
    - _mileage, _daily_price, _location
    - _features : List
    - _availability : List
    --
    + reset()
    + set_owner(owner_id)
    + set_make(make)
    + set_model(model)
    + set_year(year)
    + set_mileage(mileage)
    + set_daily_price(price)
    + set_location(location)
    + add_feature(feature)
    + add_availability(start, end)
    + validate()
    + build() : dict
  }
}

package "models.car" {
  class "create_car(...)" as create_car <<Product Factory>> {
    returns car listing **dict**
  }
}

package "api.routes.cars" {
  class "POST /cars\ncreate_listing()" as create_route <<Director>> {
    instantiates **CarListingBuilder**
    fluent method calls
    **build()**
  }
}

package "services.car_service" {
  class "create_listing(car_data)" as car_create_svc {
    persists dict to **cars.json**
  }
}

CarListingBuilder ..> create_car : **build()** calls
create_route ..> CarListingBuilder : **uses**
create_route ..> car_create_svc : **create_listing**(built dict)

note right of CarListingBuilder
  **Pattern Role Mapping**
  **Builder** → **CarListingBuilder**
  **Product** → car listing **dict** (from **create_car**)
  **Director** → **api/routes/cars.py** (orchestrates build steps)
  --
  Fluent interface: each setter returns **self**.
  **validate()** ensures required fields are set.
  **build()** calls **create_car()** to produce final dict.
end note

@enduml
